&lt;li&gt;Supporting a team of talented, 8-10 Engineers including a Staff Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning our in-house, real-time abuse detection platform written in Python and Rust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with Product, Data Science, and ML to develop reusable services or architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building out the signals, datasets, and databases to support our informational needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expanding and deploying internal APIs to combat abusive content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain operations for our infrastructure on Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move quickly to respond to the moving target of abuse on Discord&lt;/li&gt;
