&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As Product Counsel, you will help shape and deliver the legal strategy to help Discord launch our next generation of B2B revenue products. You&#39;ll join our fast-moving Product Legal team, and you will have a significant impact on how Legal and the company grow.&lt;/p&gt;
