&lt;p&gt;Apps play a huge part in Discord&#39;s mission of creating a new kind of place where it’s easy to genuinely communicate, have fun hanging out, and build relationships. We believe developers are the future of Discord and have exciting plans ahead. Come join us and help build the future of our platform󠀡!&lt;/p&gt;
